{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1432669-banned-transformation-question","id":1432669,"title":"Banned Transformation Question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-01-19T04:04:28-08:00","id":1432669,"title":"Banned Transformation Question","content":"Question for the pack. The flaw Banned Transformation (unless you spend a Rage point; 3 points), how would you play it? To roll to change you must spend a Rage, 2 for instant? You have to spend a Rage but always instant change, you cannot just roll? It is confusing to me and a player wants it. Thanks for any insight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2788-armos-black","name":"Armos Black","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-19T07:04:52-08:00","id":1432680,"title":"","content":"Spenc 1 Rage to initiate the change (Let's Roll!). If the player spends another one (2 points of Rage total) the change would be instant.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/562-lachdanan","name":"Lachdanan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar562_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-19T12:55:04-08:00","id":1432704,"title":"","content":"I have also taken this flaw for my PC. I always took that you must spend Rage, but per the rules when you spend Rage, you shift instantly. No need to roll.<br /> <br /> So I have the opposite understanding as Lachdanan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-19T13:12:37-08:00","id":1432710,"title":"","content":"I'd go with Black Fox, since you can shift instant with Rage you will do this. Since can't shift without spending a Rage, you simply will not use this part of the rules.<br /> <br /> Keep in mind, that Rage doesn't come back as easily as some people think. Re-read what gives you Rage and what triggers a Rage roll. Often, triggers, like being wounded in combat are mistaken for something that regains Rage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T06:12:25-08:00","id":1432778,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1432669-banned-transformation-question?p=1432704#post1432704\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have also taken this flaw for my PC. I always took that you must spend Rage, but per the rules when you spend Rage, you shift instantly. No need to roll.<br /> <br /> So I have the opposite understanding as Lachdanan.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Rechecked &amp; rethinked. I think Fox is right and I was mistaken.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/562-lachdanan","name":"Lachdanan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar562_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T12:09:32-08:00","id":1432815,"title":"","content":"Thank you for all your comments. I am going with 1 Rage for instant change and cannot roll to change. That sounds the best. Thanks again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2788-armos-black","name":"Armos Black","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}